<div id="2026-09-10-invoice-supplier-web-lookup-and-currency" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-09-10 — Invoice entry: working web lookup + real currency detection</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Supplier auto-create now enriches from a real web search, and invoice currency is detected from the receipt instead of hardcoded.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Three defects: (1) the lookup queried DuckDuckGo's <em>Instant Answer</em> API, which returns empty for company lookups (verified: AbstractText "" / RelatedTopics []) — so suppliers were created with a name and nothing else; (2) the self-hosted SearXNG was <code>enabled: 0</code> and unreachable, and the code called it with a JSON body, which SearXNG ignores (returns HTML); (3) <code>currency</code> was hardcoded <code>'CAD'</code> while most receipts (Stripe/OpenRouter) are USD, silently mis-stating the amount.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>How.</strong> Started the <code>comserv2-search</code> container (services/search) and set <code>enabled: 1</code> in services.json. Rewrote <code>_web_lookup_supplier</code>: SearXNG first via <strong>form-encoded GET</strong> (required — a JSON body returns HTML), falling back to a DDG HTML scrape (free, no key). Added <code>_searxng_snippets</code> / <code>_ddg_snippets</code>. Phone extraction now rejects implausible digit runs (e.g. tracking IDs) so a wrong number is never prefilled. Currency: detects USD/CAD/EUR/GBP by symbol or code and threads it through to the insert; defaults CAD when unstated.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Verified.</strong> OpenRouter → support@openrouter.ai, https://openrouter.ai; AWS → trustandsafety@support.aws.com, 206) 266-7010; unknown vendor → undef. Currency: USD/US$/CAD/EUR/default all correct. Amount regex accepts $ € £.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Model/AI2/InvoiceCreate.pm</code>, <code>Comserv/root/config/services.json</code>. Also earlier: <code>_clamp_description</code> (line description is varchar(255); a pasted receipt is ~323 chars and aborted the insert).</p>
</div>
